<ProjectLayout
  title="The End of Silence"
  tagline="A speculative soundscape imagining a future 30–40 years out where technology has drowned out nature — and silence itself. Built for the course 'Listening to the Future: Speculating Through Soundscapes and Sonification.' I led the project: research, proposal, and producing the final audio piece."
